{"seq":1,"slug":"project-scaffolding","title":"项目脚手架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/project-scaffolding","wordCount":792,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目脚手架\">项目脚手架</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>项目脚手架是把一个想法落成&quot;贡献者能快速上手的仓库&quot;的起点。它围绕几个核心件展开：许可证界定法律边界，README 传达项目价值，贡献指南降低参与门槛，自动化工具统一代码风格。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心文件</td>\n<td>LICENSE、README、CONTRIBUTING.md、.gitignore 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>README</td>\n<td>项目门面，应在 30 秒内让读者理解项目价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CONTRIBUTING.md</td>\n<td>面向贡献者的操作手册，降低参与门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EditorConfig</td>\n<td>跨编辑器统一缩进、换行等格式约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码规范工具链</td>\n<td>ESLint + Prettier 保证风格一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git Hooks</td>\n<td>在提交前自动运行检查（Husky + lint-staged）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"项目结构设计\">项目结构设计</h2><p>一个规范的开源项目结构让贡献者能快速理解项目组织方式。不同类型的项目有不同的最佳结构，但核心文件是通用的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"my-awesome-lib/&#10;├── .github/&#10;│   ├── ISSUE_TEMPLATE/&#10;│   │   ├── bug_report.md&#10;│   │   └── feature_request.md&#10;│   ├── PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md&#10;│   └── workflows/&#10;│       ├── ci.yml&#10;│       └── release.yml&#10;├── src/&#10;│   ├── index.ts&#10;│   └── core/&#10;├── tests/&#10;│   └── core.test.ts&#10;├── docs/&#10;│   └── getting-started.md&#10;├── .gitignore&#10;├── .editorconfig&#10;├── LICENSE&#10;├── README.md&#10;├── CONTRIBUTING.md&#10;├── CHANGELOG.md&#10;├── package.json&#10;└── tsconfig.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">my-awesome-lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .github/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ISSUE_TEMPLATE/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bug_report.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   │</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature_request.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> workflows/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   ├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tests/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docs/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">│</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">   └──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> getting-started.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .editorconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> LICENSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> README.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CONTRIBUTING.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CHANGELOG.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">├──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">└──</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tsconfig.json</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件/目录</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>是否必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LICENSE</td>\n<td>开源许可证</td>\n<td>✅ 必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>README.md</td>\n<td>项目说明入口</td>\n<td>✅ 必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CONTRIBUTING.md</td>\n<td>贡献者指南</td>\n<td>✅ 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHANGELOG.md</td>\n<td>变更记录</td>\n<td>✅ 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</td>\n<td>行为准则</td>\n<td>✅ 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.github/</td>\n<td>GitHub 配置</td>\n<td>✅ 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.editorconfig</td>\n<td>编辑器统一配置</td>\n<td>✅ 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.gitignore</td>\n<td>Git 忽略规则</td>\n<td>✅ 必需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"初始化项目\">初始化项目</h2><p>使用现代工具链快速初始化项目结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir my-awesome-lib &amp;&amp; cd my-awesome-lib&#10;&#10;git init&#10;&#10;npm init -y&#10;&#10;npx gitignore node&#10;&#10;cat &gt; .editorconfig &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;root = true&#10;&#10;[*]&#10;indent_style = space&#10;indent_size = 2&#10;end_of_line = lf&#10;charset = utf-8&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = true&#10;insert_final_newline = true&#10;&#10;[*.md]&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = false&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-awesome-lib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-awesome-lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gitignore</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .editorconfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">root = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">indent_style = space</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">indent_size = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">end_of_line = lf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">charset = utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">trim_trailing_whitespace = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">insert_final_newline = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[*.md]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">trim_trailing_whitespace = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    INIT[项目初始化] --&gt; REPO[Git 仓库]&#10;    INIT --&gt; PKG[包管理配置]&#10;    INIT --&gt; LINT[代码规范工具]&#10;    REPO --&gt; REMOTE[关联远程仓库]&#10;    PKG --&gt; DEPS[安装依赖]&#10;    LINT --&gt; FORMAT[格式化配置]&#10;    LINT --&gt; CHECK[静态检查配置]&#10;    FORMAT --&gt; HOOKS[Git Hooks]&#10;    CHECK --&gt; HOOKS\">graph TD\n    INIT[项目初始化] --&gt; REPO[Git 仓库]\n    INIT --&gt; PKG[包管理配置]\n    INIT --&gt; LINT[代码规范工具]\n    REPO --&gt; REMOTE[关联远程仓库]\n    PKG --&gt; DEPS[安装依赖]\n    LINT --&gt; FORMAT[格式化配置]\n    LINT --&gt; CHECK[静态检查配置]\n    FORMAT --&gt; HOOKS[Git Hooks]\n    CHECK --&gt; HOOKS</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>.editorconfig</code> 可以确保不同编辑器和 IDE 的用户都遵循统一的代码格式，减少因格式差异产生的无意义 diff。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"代码规范工具链\">代码规范工具链</h2><p>自动化的代码规范工具能显著降低 Code Review 中关于格式的讨论，让审查聚焦于逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install -D eslint prettier eslint-config-prettier&#10;&#10;npm install -D husky lint-staged&#10;&#10;npx husky init&#10;&#10;cat &gt; .husky/pre-commit &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;npx lint-staged&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prettier</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eslint-config-prettier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint-staged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> husky</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .husky/pre-commit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx lint-staged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;lint-staged&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;*.{ts,tsx}&quot;: [&quot;eslint --fix&quot;, &quot;prettier --write&quot;],&#10;    &quot;*.{json,md,yml}&quot;: [&quot;prettier --write&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lint-staged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{ts,tsx}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eslint --fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"*.{json,md,yml}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prettier --write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>配置文件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ESLint</td>\n<td>代码质量检查</td>\n<td>eslint.config.mjs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prettier</td>\n<td>代码格式化</td>\n<td>.prettierrc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Husky</td>\n<td>Git Hooks 管理</td>\n<td>.husky/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lint-staged</td>\n<td>暂存文件检查</td>\n<td>package.json</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>commitlint</td>\n<td>提交信息规范检查</td>\n<td>commitlint.config.mjs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"readme-撰写\">README 撰写</h2><p>README 是项目的门面，决定了访问者是否会进一步了解你的项目。一个优秀的 README 应在 30 秒内让读者理解项目价值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# My Awesome Lib&#10;&#10;&gt; 一句话描述项目做什么&#10;&#10;[![CI](https://github.com/user/repo/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](...) [![npm](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/my-awesome-lib)](...) [![License](https://img.shields.io/github/license/user/repo)](...)&#10;&#10;## 特性&#10;&#10;- ✅ 特性一：具体描述&#10;- ✅ 特性二：具体描述&#10;- ✅ 特性三：具体描述&#10;&#10;## 快速开始&#10;&#10;安装、配置、第一个示例（3 步以内）&#10;&#10;## 文档&#10;&#10;链接到完整文档站点&#10;&#10;## 贡献&#10;&#10;链接到 CONTRIBUTING.md&#10;&#10;## 许可证&#10;&#10;MIT\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># My Awesome Lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">> 一句话描述项目做什么</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">![CI](https://github.com/user/repo/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">![npm](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/my-awesome-lib)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">![License](https://img.shields.io/github/license/user/repo)</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 特性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ✅ 特性一：具体描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ✅ 特性二：具体描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ✅ 特性三：具体描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 快速开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">安装、配置、第一个示例（3 步以内）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">链接到完整文档站点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 贡献</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">链接到 CONTRIBUTING.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 许可证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MIT</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    VISITOR[访问者] --&gt; README[README]&#10;    README --&gt; HOOK[30秒理解价值]&#10;    HOOK --&gt; INSTALL[快速安装]&#10;    INSTALL --&gt; EXAMPLE[运行示例]&#10;    EXAMPLE --&gt; DOCS[深入文档]&#10;    DOCS --&gt; CONTRIBUTE[参与贡献]\">graph LR\n    VISITOR[访问者] --&gt; README[README]\n    README --&gt; HOOK[30秒理解价值]\n    HOOK --&gt; INSTALL[快速安装]\n    INSTALL --&gt; EXAMPLE[运行示例]\n    EXAMPLE --&gt; DOCS[深入文档]\n    DOCS --&gt; CONTRIBUTE[参与贡献]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"contributing-md-指南\">CONTRIBUTING.md 指南</h2><p>贡献指南是面向潜在贡献者的操作手册。它应该降低参与门槛，而不是制造障碍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# 贡献指南&#10;&#10;感谢你对本项目的关注！以下指南将帮助你快速参与贡献。&#10;&#10;## 开发环境&#10;&#10;- Node.js &gt;= 18&#10;- pnpm &gt;= 8&#10;&#10;## 搭建步骤&#10;&#10;1. Fork 并 Clone 仓库&#10;2. 运行 `pnpm install`&#10;3. 运行 `pnpm test` 确认环境正常&#10;4. 创建特性分支 `git checkout -b feat/your-feature`&#10;&#10;## 提交规范&#10;&#10;本项目使用 Conventional Commits 规范。&#10;&#10;## Pull Request 流程&#10;&#10;1. 确保所有测试通过&#10;2. 更新相关文档&#10;3. 填写 PR 模板&#10;4. 等待 Code Review\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 贡献指南</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">感谢你对本项目的关注！以下指南将帮助你快速参与贡献。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 开发环境</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Node.js >= 18</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pnpm >= 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 搭建步骤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fork 并 Clone 仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 运行 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`pnpm install`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 运行 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`pnpm test`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 确认环境正常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 创建特性分支 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git checkout -b feat/your-feature`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 提交规范</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">本项目使用 Conventional Commits 规范。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Pull Request 流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 确保所有测试通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 更新相关文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 填写 PR 模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 等待 Code Review</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>内容要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>环境要求</td>\n<td>运行时版本、包管理器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搭建步骤</td>\n<td>从 Clone 到运行测试的完整流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发命令</td>\n<td>构建、测试、lint 等常用命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交规范</td>\n<td>Commit Message 格式要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 流程</td>\n<td>提交和审查流程说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为准则</td>\n<td>链接到 Code of Conduct</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 定期邀请新贡献者试用你的 CONTRIBUTING.md，收集反馈并持续改进。如果有人在搭建环境时遇到困难，说明指南还不够完善。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((项目脚手架))&#10;    项目结构&#10;      核心文件&#10;      目录组织&#10;      配置文件&#10;    初始化&#10;      Git 仓库&#10;      包管理&#10;      EditorConfig&#10;    代码规范&#10;      ESLint&#10;      Prettier&#10;      Husky + lint-staged&#10;    文档&#10;      README&#10;      CONTRIBUTING.md&#10;      Badge 徽章\">mindmap\n  root((项目脚手架))\n    项目结构\n      核心文件\n      目录组织\n      配置文件\n    初始化\n      Git 仓库\n      包管理\n      EditorConfig\n    代码规范\n      ESLint\n      Prettier\n      Husky + lint-staged\n    文档\n      README\n      CONTRIBUTING.md\n      Badge 徽章</pre><ul>\n<li>规范的项目结构让贡献者能快速理解项目组织，降低参与门槛。</li>\n<li>LICENSE、README、CONTRIBUTING.md 和 .gitignore 是开源项目的必备文件。</li>\n<li>自动化代码规范工具（ESLint + Prettier + Husky）减少格式相关的 Review 讨论。</li>\n<li>README 应在 30 秒内传达项目价值，包含安装、示例和文档链接。</li>\n<li>CONTRIBUTING.md 是面向贡献者的操作手册，应持续根据反馈改进。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"项目脚手架","id":"项目脚手架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"项目结构设计","id":"项目结构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"初始化项目","id":"初始化项目"},{"level":2,"text":"代码规范工具链","id":"代码规范工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"README 撰写","id":"readme-撰写"},{"level":2,"text":"CONTRIBUTING.md 指南","id":"contributing-md-指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"社区礼仪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/getting-started/community-etiquette"},"next":{"title":"文档策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/documentation-strategy"}}